  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cassava and Maize Production and Cassava Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agnangnan cooperative will use grant funds to build production capacity and purchase equipment to transform cassava into gari while also investing in training for its members in financial management, marketing, improved production techniques, and hygiene and sanitation practices for production.,</narrative>
  </description>
